From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 20:20:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/memfd: silence memfd_create missing exec flags warning

Silence deprecation warning when memfd_create is called without execution flags,
preventing boot log pollution by Qt/QML applications.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded kiosk customization]

diff --git a/mm/memfd.c b/mm/memfd.c
index a8e2b34..1b4c910 100644
--- a/mm/memfd.c
+++ b/mm/memfd.c
@@ -317,7 +317,4 @@ SYSCALL_DEFINE2(memfd_create,
 	if (!(flags & (MFD_EXEC | MFD_NOEXEC_SEAL))) {
-		pr_warn_once(
-			"%s[%d]: memfd_create() called without MFD_EXEC or MFD_NOEXEC_SEAL set\n",
-			current->comm, task_pid_nr(current));
 	}
 
 	error = check_sysctl_memfd_noexec(&flags);
